      "message": "I think adding a prefix to the dex locations is kind of against the point of `GetLibCoreDexLocations`, because `GetLibCoreDexLocations` is supposed to return where the dex files would be located on an Android device at runtime. I think this change will break our usages of generate-boot-image on Golem and the local Compiler Explorer.\n\nIf you need to generate a boot image with a special dex location prefix for the simulator, could you please add a flag (suggested names: `--target-android-root`, `--device-android-root`, `--runtime-android-root`, `--android-root-for-location`), and call `GetLibCoreDexFileNames` with the value of the flag to build the dex locations?",
